{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Baikal</strong> is a story about a journey, where the road becomes a mirror of memory.<br>You play as a young woman setting out on a trip, and step by step her past and present intertwine, creating a deeply personal tale of self-discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What makes this visual novel unique?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the very beginning, the player can choose between <strong>two distinct visual styles</strong>: experience the story in <strong>photorealistic detail</strong> or in an <strong>expressive engraving-inspired style</strong>. Each option creates its own mood and casts the same events in a new light.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac A personal and emotional story about the road and memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A linear narrative focused entirely on the heroine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Two artistic styles to choose from \u2014 tailor the atmosphere to your taste</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967480?t=1756030776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967480?t=1756030776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967480/82fee198353c154c1f88d950f9b092cb94b20146/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756030776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967480/82fee198353c154c1f88d950f9b092cb94b20146/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756030776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of Baikal</strong> is a story about a journey, where the roa